   "roundness": null,
   "text": "'late-evening sitting' written at midday; a TODO item dated\nitself 'midnight' without checking. every honest time so far\nexists because a hand ran date. git already timestamps every\ncommit - rung LANDINGS are boundable today; missing: start\ntimes, in-session moments, the human's clock, and the model\nconsulting one while writing prose.",
