   "roundness": null,
   "text": "task start + task end = duration; accumulated durations =\nthe base that makes effort estimates for future tasks\naccurate instead of guessed. slice 1 captures HONEST ACTUALS\nonly - estimates themselves are the parked journey view's\nslice when it wakes (its named prerequisite: time data needs\nan on-disk home).",
